// Title: Modify Group Policy Settings
// ID: ada4b0c4-758b-46ac-9033-9004613a150d
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-08-19
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1484.001
// Description: Detect malicious GPO modifications can be used to implement many other malicious behaviors.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_GroupPolicyRefreshTimeDC*" or process.command_line like "*_GroupPolicyRefreshTimeOffsetDC*" or process.command_line like "*_GroupPolicyRefreshTime*" or process.command_line like "*_GroupPolicyRefreshTimeOffset*" or process.command_line like "*_EnableSmartScreen*" or process.command_line like "*_ShellSmartScreenLevel*")) and (process.command_line like "*_\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\System*") and ((process.executable endswith "\\reg.exe") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "reg.exe")))
